{"title":"2006 IMO Shortlist Problems/A2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/A2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>(<i>Poland</i>)\nThe sequence of real number <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/b/82b5f31c7779c8b787524e8315a8a1a984d09c44.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_0, a_1, a_2, \\dots$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"95\" height=\"11\" /> is defined recursively by\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/5/d/55de2f877a6da24fb7529f35057fc9f818b7d167.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle a_0 = -1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"63\" height=\"14\" />,\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/5/3459e3c1238ea035703e7862d9d2d46ed65fee2d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=0}^n \\frac{a_{n-k}}{k+1} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"107\" height=\"48\" />\nfor <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897470a282b6b85fa5221eacd41369b9a157f491.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>Show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/3/40314f7bbfb4ef40127e7d492f456b6722dd9f50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle {} a_n &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"15\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/9/7/897470a282b6b85fa5221eacd41369b9a157f491.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n \\ge 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><i>This was also Problem 6 of the 2007 <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Poland_Math_Olympiad\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Poland Math Olympiad\">Poland Math Olympiad</a>.</i>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/A2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We proceed by induction on <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/7/8c7447db63092942e0a39cfe01d3d94174a89707.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle n$\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" />.  For the base case, we note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/7/fa7bf70474d9ad1b7c8dcc92422a38a73d40a809.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle a_1 = 1/2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"68\" height=\"18\" />.  Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/8/918dfe4e84cfbde771404b0e0ee3dfa72b63a13d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, \\dots, a_{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"11\" /> are positive.  We note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/c/84c73ddd07414ee9575e3dded97158a88d3881d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\displaystyle a_n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"20\" height=\"13\" /> is positive if and only if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/1/9216e5ce0d96884c87d6625110b3159e854a6272.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^n \\frac{a_{n-k}}{k+1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"72\" height=\"48\" /> is negative.  Now, since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/8/918dfe4e84cfbde771404b0e0ee3dfa72b63a13d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_1, \\dots, a_{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"11\" /> are all positive, we know\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/4/35437b593f69a07c0c7a36050584e5868d1196b9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${} - \\frac{a_0}{n+1} = \\frac{n}{n+1} \\cdot \\left( -\\frac{a_0}{n} \\right) = \\frac{n}{n+1} \\sum_{k=0}^{n-2}\\frac{a_{n-1-k}}{k+1} &gt; \\sum_{k=0}^{n-2} \\frac{k+1}{k+2} \\cdot \\frac{a_{n-1-k}}{k+1} = \\sum_{k=0}^{n-2} \\frac{a_{n-1-k}}{k+2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"645\" height=\"50\" />\n.\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>This means that\n</p>\n<center>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/7/797e6c2231da362e3a85ac8cb9c4769d82d04f41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\sum_{k=1}^{n} = \\frac{a_0}{n+1} + \\sum_{k=1}^{n-1} \\frac{a_{n-k}}{k+1} = \\frac{a_0}{n+1} + \\sum_{k=0}^{n-2}\\frac{a_{n-1-k}}{k+2} &lt; \\frac{a_0}{n+1} - \\frac{a_0}{n+1} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -20px\" width=\"542\" height=\"50\" />,\n</p>\n</center>\n<p>as desired.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Resources\">Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_IMO_Shortlist_Problems/A2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_IMO_Shortlist_Problems\" title=\"2006 IMO Shortlist Problems\">2006 IMO Shortlist Problems</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2007_Poland_Math_Olympiad_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2007 Poland Math Olympiad Problems (page does not exist)\">2007 Poland Math Olympiad Problems</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/viewtopic.php?p=821388#821388\">Discussion on AoPS/MathLinks</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018052450\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.015 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.028 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 79/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 2/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3007/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:5149:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018052450 and revision id 15767. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}